---
import portrait from "../assets/portrait.jpg";
import portraitStanding from "../assets/portrait-standing.jpg";
import Figure from "../components/Figure.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import PageTitle from "../components/PageTitle.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="about pierre spring"
  description="Full stack web developer based in Zürich, Switzerland."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="subgrid-cols pt-32 pb-24">
    <article class="col-full subgrid-cols space-y-12">
      <header class="col-main">
        <PageTitle title="about pierre spring" />
      </header>

      <section class="prose-manuscript col-full subgrid-cols">
        <p>
          I'm Pierre, a full stack web developer with over 20 years of
          experience, based in Zurich, Switzerland. I specialize in
          <em>TypeScript</em> and care deeply about clean, maintainable code — which
          I believe is a side-effect of continuously evolving and adapting the development
          process through code reviews, pair programming, and automated testing.
        </p>

        <Figure src={portrait} alt="Portrait of Pierre Spring">
          FIG 1.0: Portrait of Pierre Spring by <a
            href="https://www.andersstoos.com/">Anders Stoos</a
          >.
        </Figure>

        <h2>Experience</h2>

        <p>
          <em>since 2026</em> Frontend Developer <strong>ICFM&nbsp;AG</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          <em>2013 — 2026</em> Node.js and Frontend Developer <strong
            >Freelance</strong
          >
        </p>

        <div class="text-light-gray italic">
          <p>Selected projects:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">Migros</span> next.js and contentful website
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">BKW</span> web components style guide
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">Republik</span> Node.js backend for the Swiss
              online newspaper
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">SBB</span> frontend development on the website
              relaunch
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">Neue Zürcher Zeitung & Livingdocs</span> full-stack
              publication tool
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-white">Credit Suisse</span> website redesign
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p>
          <em>2011 – 2013</em> Co-founder and Lead Frontend Developer <strong
            >Nelmio&nbsp;AG</strong
          >
        </p>

        <div class="text-light-gray italic">
          We bootstrapped a remote web agency specializing in single page
          applications, working with clients including local.ch, Zürcher
          Kantonalbank, Unic, Ginetta, and Swiss.
        </div>
        <div class="text-light-gray italic">
          First steps into the world of open source.
        </div>

        <p>
          <em>2005 – 2011</em> Full Stack Web Developer <strong
            >Liip&nbsp;AG</strong
          >
        </p>

        <div class="text-light-gray italic">
          My early career spanning the evolution of responsive design, HTML5
          adoption, and frontend specialization.
        </div>

        <p>
          <em>2000 – 2006</em> BSc Computer Science <strong
            >University of Fribourg</strong
          >
        </p>

        <h2>Community</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>JSZurich</strong> 2011–2015<br />
            Organized a monthly JavaScript meetup.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>SwissJS Conference</strong> 2012–2015<br />
            Organized a national JavaScript community event.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Public Speaking</strong> 2011–2015<br />
            Conference talks on performance and maintainable code.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Interests</h2>

        <p>
          Vintage computers (<em>IBM 5155</em> running Minix), self-hosted
          <em>homelab</em> with <em>ZFS</em> and containers, playing the
          <em>accordion</em>, and father of four&nbsp;❤️.
        </p>

        <Figure
          src={portraitStanding}
          alt="Portrait Pierre Spring standing"
          fullBleed
        >
          FIG 1.1: Portrait of Pierre Spring by <a
            href="https://www.andersstoos.com/">Anders Stoos</a
          >.
        </Figure>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
